{
  "_comment": [
    "Per-firmware export offsets for the PS VR2 system libraries, keyed by the",
    "function name the app resolves. Generated from decrypted libraries by",
    "gen_export_table.py (see README.md); consumed by the same script to emit",
    "platform/ps5/hmd2/hmd2_exports.h. Never edit offsets by hand: a wrong",
    "offset cannot be detected at runtime, only the anchor string can.",
    "fw is the firmware without the dot (1360 = 13.60), as in PS5VR.",
    "'anchor' is the check string: {virtual address in the library, text}. The",
    "app uses a table only if the string sits at that address in the loaded",
    "library's read-only segment, so a table can never be applied to a build it",
    "was not generated from.",
    "Source: PS5VR app/src/vr_exports_1360.h and vr_exports_761.h (GPL-3.0,",
    "Source: PS5VR app/src/vr_exports_*.h (GPL-3.0, see platform/ps5/hmd2/NOTICE);",
    "9.00 only from Ghost-VR's vr_exports.h (theghostonline, GPL-3.0), which also",
    "agrees with PS5VR on every other firmware here. 13.60 and 12.40 were run on a",
    "console by PS5VR; the other tables were checked against that firmware's",
    "libraries, not run. 7.61 and 7.20 ship the same libraries, so the 761 table",
    "serves both. VrHand has a table for 12.20 and later only: below that it takes",
    "other parameters."
  ],
